On Mon, 21 Nov 2005, Sidsel Horvei wrote:

> In this game, however, I found a second 'rustproof splintmail' generated
> on the floor of the first room. Should that at all be possible? And if
> so, should it be known to me that it was rustproof?

For SAM, all splint mails generated at the beginning of the game or in the
quest are rustproof, and this is explicitly made known to the player. The
condition is actually  (moves <= 1 || In_quest(&u.uz)) , which makes all
splint mails on the first level fall into that category.

I don't think this makes sense; only the armour on the quest and in
the starting inventory should be rustproof. You should ask the DevTeam
whether this is intended.

